<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ Housing Corp calls in SFO, Inland Revenue.</title>
<headline>NZ Housing Corp calls in SFO, Inland Revenue.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-12-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Housing Corp of New Zealand said on Thursday it had referred details of an internal investigation to both the Serious Fraud Squad and Inland Revenue.</p>
<p>It said it had received information of alleged impropriety on a number of mortgagee sales.</p>
<p>&quot;These allegations relate to the actions of an agent for the corporation and a third party,&quot; Housing Corp said.</p>
<p>It said the investigation had no connection with the review of the Mortgage Guarantee Scheme.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
</text>
